{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["What number should the urgent ending give for people reporting a dangerous fault?","Which job types do you quote from photos, and which always need a site visit?","Do you cover commercial properties, or only homes?","Is there an area you don't travel beyond, and should the form say so?"],"howToUseResponses":"Check the fault scope and wiring age before anything else: a whole-property fault in older wiring is rarely a quick fix and usually needs a visit. Photos of the fuse board tell you a lot about what you'll find, so quote small new work straight from them when you can. Group requests by postcode to plan visits on the same day.","customizeSteps":["Put your own urgent phone number in the safety ending, and test that path before you publish.","Edit the work types to match what you do, such as solar, alarms or commercial fit-outs, and route each to the right follow-up.","Share the link from your website, van signage or quote replies, and export requests to CSV if you plan jobs in a spreadsheet."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should an electrical quote form include?","a":"The type of work, a description with quantities, the property type, the address, photos and the customer's contact details. Asking about the age of the wiring helps spot jobs that need a visit."},{"q":"Can an electrician quote without a site visit?","a":"For small, clear jobs with good photos, often yes. Faults, rewires and older properties usually need someone to look first."},{"q":"Why does this form start with a safety question?","a":"Someone with sparking or a burning smell shouldn't be filling in a quote form. The first answer sends them to urgent advice before anything else."},{"q":"Can customers send photos through the form?","a":"Yes. The form has an upload question for pictures or a short video of the fuse board and the work area."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Electrical quote","description":"Get enough detail on an electrical job to price it or plan a visit.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_electric00","ref":"welcome","title":"Need an electrician? Tell us about the job and we'll come back with a price or a time to look.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_electric01","ref":"danger","title":"First, a safety check: is anything sparking, smelling of burning, or has anyone had a shock?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes, it has","noLabel":"No, nothing like that"},{"id":"blk_electric02","ref":"work_type","title":"What kind of work is it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_something_isn_t","label":"Something isn't working","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_new_sockets_lights","label":"New sockets, lights or circuits","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_rewire_or_fuse","label":"Rewire or fuse board upgrade","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_ev_charger_installation","label":"EV charger installation","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_inspection_or_safety","label":"Inspection or safety certificate","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_electric03","ref":"fault_details","title":"What's happening, and when did it start?","description":"For example: a breaker keeps tripping, lights flicker, one socket is dead.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_electric04","ref":"fault_scope","title":"How much of the property is affected?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_one_socket_or","label":"One socket or light","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_one_room","label":"One room","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_several_rooms","label":"Several rooms","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_the_whole_property","label":"The whole property","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_electric05","ref":"work_details","title":"Describe the work: what you'd like, where, and how many of each","description":"For example: six downlights in the kitchen and two double sockets in the garage.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1500,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_electric06","ref":"property_type","title":"What kind of property is it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_house","label":"House","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_flat_or_apartment","label":"Flat or apartment","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_office","label":"Office","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_shop_restaurant_or","label":"Shop, restaurant or other commercial space","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_industrial_unit","label":"Industrial unit","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_electric07","ref":"wiring_age","title":"Roughly how old is the wiring?","description":"It helps us know what we might find behind the walls.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_less_than_10","label":"Less than 10 years","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_10_to_30","label":"10 to 30 years","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_over_30_years","label":"Over 30 years","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no_idea","label":"No idea","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_electric08","ref":"photos","title":"Can you add photos of the fuse board and the area you need work on?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"file_upload","accept":["image/*","video/*"],"maxFiles":5,"maxSizeMB":10},{"id":"blk_electric09","ref":"address","title":"Where's the property?","req